<title>CANADA: CWB sees Prairie harvest 26 pct complete Sept 9.</title>
<headline>CWB sees Prairie harvest 26 pct complete Sept 9.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Wheat Board on Thursday said harvest of the Prairies six major grains and oilseeds was 26 percent complete by Sept 9 compared to 35 percent at the same time last year.</p>
<p>CROP     ALBERTA SASKATCHEWAN MANITOBA (PCT) AT SEPT 9</p>
<p>s.wheat  23	21	     40</p>
<p>durum    69	28	     50</p>
<p>oats     16	15	     10</p>
<p>barley   32	29	     40</p>
<p>flax	3	 0		3</p>
<p>canola   29	25	     20  western Canada</p>
<p>Total:   29	23	     31	 26</p>
<p>last wk  27	16	     22	 20</p>
<p>last yr  31	28	     59	 35</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
